#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:75
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "&kde; offers you the possibility to have several virtual desktops. In "
#| "this tab you can configure the number of desktops as well as their names. "
#| "Just use the slider to adjust the number of desktops. You can assign "
#| "names to the desktops by entering text into the text fields below."
msgid ""
"&kde; offers you the possibility to have several virtual desktops. In this "
"tab you can configure the number of desktops, the number of rows in the "
"<guilabel>Pager</guilabel> icon as well as their names. Just use the input "
"box to adjust the number of desktops. You can assign names to the desktops "
"by entering text into the text fields below."
msgstr ""
"KDE ផ្ដល់លទ្ធភាព​ឲ្យអ្នក​មាន​ផ្ទៃតុ​និម្មិត​ច្រើន ។ នៅក្នុង​ផ្ទាំង​នេះ អ្នក​អាច​កំណត់​រចនា​សម្ព័ន្ធ​ចំនួន​ផ្ទៃតុ​ព្រម​"
"ទាំង​ឈ្មោះ​របស់​វាផងដែរ ។ ដោយគ្រាន់តែ​ប្រើ​គ្រាប់​រំកិល​ដើម្បី​លៃតម្រូវ​ចំនួន​ផ្ទៃតុ ។ អ្នក​អាច​ផ្ដល់​ឈ្មោះ​ទៅ​ឲ្យ​"
"ផ្ទៃតុ​បាន ដោយ​បញ្ចូល​អត្ថបទ​ទៅក្នុង​វាល​អត្ថបទ​ខាងក្រោម ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:81
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Enable <guilabel>Different widgets for each desktop</guilabel> to use "
"independent widgets and wallpapers on each individual desktop."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:93
#, no-c-format
msgid "Switching"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:97
#, no-c-format
msgid "Desktop navigation wraps around"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:98
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Enable this option if you want keyboard or active desktop border navigation "
"beyond the edge of a desktop to take you to the opposite edge of the new "
"desktop."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:104
#, no-c-format
msgid "Desktop Effect Animation"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:105
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select <guilabel>No Animation</guilabel>, <guilabel>Slide</guilabel>, "
"<guilabel>Desktop Cube Animation</guilabel> or <guilabel>Fade Desktop</"
"guilabel> from the drop down box. If the selected animation has settings "
"options, click on the tools icon on the right of the drop down box to launch "
"a configuration dialog."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:113
#, no-c-format
msgid "Desktop Switch On-Screen Display"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:114
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Enable this option if you want to have an on-screen display for desktop "
"switching."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:119
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show desktop layout indicators"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:120
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Enabling this option will show a small preview of the desktop layout "
"indicating the selected desktop."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:126
#, no-c-format
msgid "Shortcuts"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:127
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This section displays the configured shortcuts for switching the desktops "
"and allows you to edit them."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:134
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "If you enable <guilabel>Mouse wheel over desktop switches desktop</"
#| "guilabel> then scrolling the wheel over an empty space on the desktop "
#| "will change the the next virtual desktop numerically, in the direction "
#| "you scrolled (either up or down)."
msgid ""
"Scrolling the mouse wheel over an empty space on the desktop or on the "
"<guilabel>Pager</guilabel> icon in the panel will change to the next virtual "
"desktop numerically, in the direction you scrolled (either up or down)."
msgstr ""
"ប្រសិន​បើអ្នក​ធីក <guilabel>កង់កណ្ដុរ​លើផ្ទៃខាងក្រោយផ្ទៃតុ​ ប្ដូរ​ផ្ទៃតុ</guilabel> នៅពេល​នោះ ការ​"
"រមូរកង់កណ្ដុរ​លើ​ផ្ទៃទទេ​នៅលើ​ផ្ទៃតុ នឹង​ផ្លាស់ប្ដូរ​ផ្ទៃតុ​និម្មិត​បន្ទាប់​​តាម​លេខរៀង គឺ​តាម​ទិស​ដែលអ្នក​បាន​រមូរ "
"(ឡើង​លើ ឬ​ចុះក្រោម) ។"

